# THE debug framework: each Game-<game>/ folder hosts ONLY regenerable per-run DATA (ModParse data-<Mod>,
# Logtriage log-CURR*, SaveParse save-CURR*) and NO code/config — so ignore the Game-* folders WHOLESALE at repo
# level (one rule here, not a .gitignore peppered into each data folder). The masters recreate the folder on demand.
tools/Game-*/
# Per-machine game config (abs paths — may contain the OS username) lives in Framework-common WITH the config
# code — NEVER commit (PII). Its config_game.example.toml template + config_naming.toml ARE tracked.
tools/Framework-common/config_game.toml
